(7599369, 1227497, 163081, '<td valign="top">I like his picture but the blue of the lake is over saturated. 6 from me</td>', 'I like his picture but the blue of the lake is over saturated. 6 from me', '2018-10-24 08:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599409, 1227572, 88291, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2018-10-24 18:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599410, 1227618, 88291, '<td valign="top">Somehow B&amp;W just doesn''t seem to do this justice. And what is that in the upper left hand corner?</td>', 'Somehow B&W just doesn''t seem to do this justice. And what is that in the upper left hand corner?', '2018-10-24 18:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599411, 1227315, 88291, '<td valign="top">Somehow seems to have lost the foliage-theme.</td>', 'Somehow seems to have lost the foliage-theme.', '2018-10-24 18:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599412, 1227690, 88291, '<td valign="top">Overall, very nice. Too bad the river is brown.</td>', 'Overall, very nice. Too bad the river is brown.', '2018-10-24 18:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599413, 1227665, 88291, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little too much red?</td>', 'Maybe a little too much red?', '2018-10-24 18:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599414, 1227671, 88291, '<td valign="top">Nature''s first law of foliage-building-use: don''t use the roof.</td>', 'Nature''s first law of foliage-building-use: don''t use the roof.', '2018-10-24 18:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599461, 1227667, 179769, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, but the waterfall shouldn''t be the eyecatcher in this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful image, but the waterfall shouldn''t be the eyecatcher in this challenge.', '2018-10-25 15:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599462, 1227315, 179769, '<td valign="top">Is this about foliage or flags?</td>', 'Is this about foliage or flags?', '2018-10-25 15:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599463, 1227547, 179769, '<td valign="top">Is this about a bird or foliage?</td>', 'Is this about a bird or foliage?', '2018-10-25 15:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599464, 1227618, 179769, '<td valign="top">"Red"?</td>', '"Red"?', '2018-10-25 15:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599465, 1227527, 179769, '<td valign="top">This challenge is about foliage, not wildlife (which takes away a point or two), but a beautiful photo!</td>', 'This challenge is about foliage, not wildlife (which takes away a point or two), but a beautiful photo!', '2018-10-25 15:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599466, 1227572, 179769, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2018-10-25 15:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599586, 1227633, 50492, '<td valign="top">I love the symmetry.</td>', 'I love the symmetry.', '2018-10-28 19:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599587, 1227587, 50492, '<td valign="top">Wonderful placement and balance.</td>', 'Wonderful placement and balance.', '2018-10-28 19:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599589, 1227433, 65234, '<td valign="top">I looked at the thumbnail and thought, "That looks like a hippopotamus." Which struck me as unexpected in a foliage challenge. And it is, indeed, a hippopotamus. But s''he''s eating a leaf, so it qualifies. Kudos for being different.</td>', 'I looked at the thumbnail and thought, "That looks like a hippopotamus." Which struck me as unexpected in a foliage challenge. And it is, indeed, a hippopotamus. But s''he''s eating a leaf, so it qualifies. Kudos for being different.', '2018-10-28 19:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599590, 1227428, 65234, '<td valign="top">And an ant for perspective. I like the somber tones here.</td>', 'And an ant for perspective. I like the somber tones here.', '2018-10-28 19:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599591, 1227547, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice hawk! And he does blend in well, colorwise.</td>', 'Nice hawk! And he does blend in well, colorwise.', '2018-10-28 19:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599592, 1227527, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting. Lovely light.</td>', 'Looks like a painting. Lovely light.', '2018-10-28 19:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599593, 1227524, 65234, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W is an interesting choice in this rather colorful challenge. But I think it works here. Amazing where trees manage to grow sometimes.</td>', 'B&W is an interesting choice in this rather colorful challenge. But I think it works here. Amazing where trees manage to grow sometimes.', '2018-10-28 19:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599594, 1227693, 65234, '<td valign="top">Ooh, funky! Like the arms of the trees in the Wizard of Oz, only green.</td>', 'Ooh, funky! Like the arms of the trees in the Wizard of Oz, only green.', '2018-10-28 19:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599595, 1227591, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like a lovely place to be. I like the light here.</td>', 'Looks like a lovely place to be. I like the light here.', '2018-10-28 19:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599623, 1227687, 135744, '<td valign="top">Hmm silky water just like Janine does but she doesn''t live in Yorkshire. Very well played.</td>', 'Hmm silky water just like Janine does but she doesn''t live in Yorkshire. Very well played.', '2018-10-29 04:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599628, 1227679, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a delightful little feature to have in your garden! I rather wish that the leaf of the fern wasn''t up quite so very tight to the left hand edge, and I do feel that the bright fronds of foliage in the top right pull the eye too much, but none the less a pleasing photo. 6.</td>', 'What a delightful little feature to have in your garden! I rather wish that the leaf of the fern wasn''t up quite so very tight to the left hand edge, and I do feel that the bright fronds of foliage in the top right pull the eye too much, but none the less a pleasing photo. 6.', '2018-10-29 09:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599629, 1227515, 67258, '<td valign="top">I get why you have included so much background - part of your story, but I find that the white shape - a bridge maybe? - fights for attention.  I would probably have scored higher if it was an 8x10 crop, cropped at the top of the highest reed.  6.</td>', 'I get why you have included so much background - part of your story, but I find that the white shape - a bridge maybe? - fights for attention.  I would probably have scored higher if it was an 8x10 crop, cropped at the top of the highest reed.  6.', '2018-10-29 09:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599630, 1227690, 67258, '<td valign="top">now that is a lot of foliage!  I bet it looks even more spectacular this week - the challenge was a week or two too early for the full range of autumn colours.  A very pleasing scene, nicely composed.  7.</td>', 'now that is a lot of foliage!  I bet it looks even more spectacular this week - the challenge was a week or two too early for the full range of autumn colours.  A very pleasing scene, nicely composed.  7.', '2018-10-29 09:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599631, 1227428, 67258, '<td valign="top">Good rendition of textures.  i like the inclusion of the ant for scale.</td>', 'Good rendition of textures.  i like the inclusion of the ant for scale.', '2018-10-29 09:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599632, 1227433, 67258, '<td valign="top">Hilarious - what the heck is that leaf?  It must be HUGE!</td>', 'Hilarious - what the heck is that leaf?  It must be HUGE!', '2018-10-29 09:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599633, 1227661, 67258, '<td valign="top">I really like this, but it does remind me that I need to learn how to focus stack.  I would mark it higher if the dof was greater.</td>', 'I really like this, but it does remind me that I need to learn how to focus stack.  I would mark it higher if the dof was greater.', '2018-10-29 09:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599634, 1227692, 67258, '<td valign="top">The light is lovely, and you have maximised the colour of the ''turned'' leaf beautifully.  I am less keen on the inclusion of the drooping leaf that seems to be pushing its way into the fore-ground.</td>', 'The light is lovely, and you have maximised the colour of the ''turned'' leaf beautifully.  I am less keen on the inclusion of the drooping leaf that seems to be pushing its way into the fore-ground.', '2018-10-29 09:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599635, 1227527, 67258, '<td valign="top">In a Free Study I would score this very highly, but in a quandary here: the foliage is integral to the story you are telling, but not the subject. Heck, integral is good enough for me.</td>', 'In a Free Study I would score this very highly, but in a quandary here: the foliage is integral to the story you are telling, but not the subject. Heck, integral is good enough for me.', '2018-10-29 09:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
